OL,3,GNEWSAExtension of supported housing
OL,4,Acontracts proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing support services for vulnerable
OL,7,Fand homeless people in Peterborough
OL,8,Flook set to continue after councillors
OL,9,Fwere asked to extend the current
OL,10,Fcontracts.
OL,12,FThe city council has three contracts
OL,13,Fwith organisations that provide a total
OL,14,Fof 138 units of supported accommodation
OL,15,Ffor homeless households.
