OL,3,GNEWSAExtension of supported housing
OL,4,Acontracts proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cabinet is recommended to approve a
OL,7,Fone-year extension of housing related
OL,8,Fsupport contracts from 1 April 2027 to
OL,9,F31 March 2028 at a cost of #425,575,
OL,10,Fwhich will be funded by the council's
OL,11,Fexisting housing related support
OL,12,Fbudget.
OL,14,FThe proposals are designed to ensure
OL,15,Fcontinuity of services until the
OL,16,Fcouncil completes its new Supported
OL,17,FHousing Needs Assessment and Strategy.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
